# halplibe namespaces item keys, so these are item.<modid>.<name>.name -- not the bare
# item.<name>.name that vanilla BTA uses for its own items.
# Joxe Dust is a BLOCK now, so its item is keyed tile.* rather than item.* — placing it was what
# changed the key and broke the name.
tile.foolmod.joxe_dust.name=Joxe Dust
tile.foolmod.joxe_dust.desc=Fairground powder. Laid in an unbroken ring it makes a boundary the Fool dare not cross.
